      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `eb8746e0d8de3a5c8e03d2e90671f9acba3a71fc93ee161b9029c3a4ca6a4297--criminal-courts-2024-25-cube-9-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ee01b93170f3f7f22f79b7ea3848d86ce6bd4f14d1aae214c6e64756470f0b16 | missing |\n| \"Table 51\" | 1b853f2953fc7d26f83ec899e24679fa0738381644e116f681a8a0faba52abaf | missing |\n| \"Table 52\" | b9bd3fc7504a516060fb2a03a6cdf5e5d45d775c5426bea2a70f72b1e1c9512e | missing |\n| \"Table 53\" | 81d634969f61639f2c7e2e4e9ac7a4d00b4ad61e5d5e589bf844a2006b8bccf0 | missing |\n| \"Table 54\" | 9e9144299dff5c6af41f2fe9cb8d40cf4aeff40a125a6e0c4264cf7937b117c2 | missing |\n| \"Table 55\" | 96277178bdb6178555946ae85d503387e049b1fb45c278333a37edccdbefdeb0 | missing |\n| \"Table 56\" | 2e73785a01c353bc34394bbfd0a2b677fa8440d8cf079077d225a06579452a41 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (ba05918836f5da20218f0f3516f699288185b588a5ac3c5fe8a93d570ff857b9). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
